# A rule matches a path literally, so the slashed form needs a rule of its
# own. Without it the SPA fallback serves the app, which has no route for a
# bare v1 path and shows the not-found page.
#
# No `/* /index.html 200` fallback: `not_found_handling` in wrangler.jsonc
# serves index.html for every path without an asset.
/convert     /    301
/convert/    /    301
/palettes    /    301
/palettes/   /    301
